{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"29751","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v19350","staff":{"artwork":[],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"メイザーズ ぬまきち","creatorId":"vndb:s584","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s584","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s584","name":"大沼 明夫","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:130629","source":"vndb"}],"music":[],"other":[{"creditedName":"ごとう じゅんじ","creatorId":"vndb:s589","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s589","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s589","name":"後藤 潤二","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:130630","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c1596","characterName":"伊藤 誠","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"422","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"2423"},{"characterId":"422","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"28630"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10204"],"vndbCharacterId":"c1596"},"originalCharacterName":"伊藤 誠","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1016"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"88"},"height":{"reviewState":"pending-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"167"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"92"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Makoto is the unlucky protagonist of School Days, Summer Days and Shiny Days. (Appears as the main hero in Cross Days.) A generally mannered and composed student in year one of class three, his life becomes complicated when he begins to unfaithfully initiate polyamorous relationships with girls that he is unable or unwilling to singly commit to. Although he is originally casual, gregarious and understanding, after becoming a sex addict, it completely corrupts his personality and he instead became apathetic, rash, and egotistical towards others, regardless of the harm or later consequences. However, once he realizes what he has done wrong, he is quick in his attempts to fix the situation. Makoto lives with his divorced mother and has a younger sister named Itaru who lives with their father. He is childhood friends with Katou Otome and best friends with Sawanaga Taisuke."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1596"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"榊野学園1年3組。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何に対しても無気力で、めんどうくさがる流されやすい性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋愛に対しては奥手だったが、世界の後押しにより言葉と付き合い始める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、いつしか世界へと心が揺れ動いていき・・・。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10204","sourceWorkId":"11694","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"『SHINY DAYS』主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"のんびりと夏休みを過ごす平凡な青年。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は別居している妹「いたる」と浜辺で砂遊びや、港で釣り等をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"料理のレパートリーが豊富で妹の好物であるハンバーグに限らず、魚も捌いたりする等、食育にも気を使っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰にでも屈託が無く、優しい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10204","sourceWorkId":"15294","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主角。榊野学园1年3班。双亲离婚，现在和当护士的母亲同住在高级公寓。穿插在世界和言叶2位女主角之间，性格优柔寡断。在单调的日常生活中，对上学时乘坐同一辆电车的女孩产生了淡淡的爱慕之心。不擅长恋爱的他本来觉得只是远远地看着她就够了，但在世界的推动下，那样的日子产生了变化。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"太过没用的个性，加上和玩家选择的选项采取相反的行动这样烦死人的行为，结果诱致悲惨的结局，因此诚与“白色相簿”的藤井冬弥，“愿此刻永恒”的鸣海孝之并列，得到“アダルトゲームにおける最悪のヘタレ主人公(十八禁游戏中最差的愚笨主角)”这样不誉的评价。五大人渣之一。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姓氏来自日本著名政治家，第1、5、7、10任日本首相伊藤博文。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"422"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"height":[{"comparisonValue":"167","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1596","value":"167"},{"comparisonValue":"167.5","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"422","value":"167.5cm"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1e/1e953b4ac526ceeb85f18745d9005f54b2b9c69cd4abc29f42c2495f1976a122.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/20/20a6a8fca1cb225fc7d95aa7c0a56c734e507074f9298d1e958ffc577d694607.webp","width":183,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"平川大輔","creatorId":"vndb:s133","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s133","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s133","name":"平川 大輔","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:170113:422:4452:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c1597","characterName":"西園寺 世界","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"423","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"170113"},{"characterId":"423","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"2423"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8689"],"vndbCharacterId":"c1597"},"originalCharacterName":"西園寺 世界","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1207"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"height":{"reviewState":"pending-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"155"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"62"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sekai Saionji is a student in year one of class three who is the antithesis and foil of Kotonoha. A playful and outgoing classmate seated directly next to Makoto, she takes a curious interest in him during their first acquaintance, and in every medium of the series, helps to establish his bond with Kotonoha. Though genuinely upbeat, Sekai does occasionally show a more serious side, and when sufficiently frustrated can be loud, selfish, overemotional and even manipulative. She lives with her mother Youko in the fictional area of Motehara-Sakashita and works part-time as a waitress at the family restaurant Radish."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1597"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"榊野学園１年３組。天文部。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"社交的な性格で、親友の清浦刹那と共に過ごすことが多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"伊藤誠と隣の席になり、言葉と誠を付き合わせるようにし向けるも、いつしか誠に惹かれている自分をごまかせなくなってしまい・・・・・・。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8689","sourceWorkId":"11694","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"誠と同じクラス。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスの中では明るくムードメーカーで、やや小うるさいとも言われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"泰介が憧れていたように、可愛らしい容姿と明るい性格で、密かにファンは多いが、なんでもあけすけに言う性格で、告白する男の子たちは皆玉砕している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8689","sourceWorkId":"13913","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"誠と同じクラスで、隣りの席の女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく人懐こい性格で、クラスのムードメーカー。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8689","sourceWorkId":"23313","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"与母亲同住在家庭公寓。和刹那则是青梅竹马且是异母姐妹。是主要女主角之一。因其明亮的性格所以是气氛制造者。在男性之间拥有极高人气，但拒绝所有人的告白，且十分直截了当。对诚有秘密的感情，为了得到接近诚的借口而和他人调位坐在诚的旁边（原本是刹那的座位）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在诚与言叶交往之前，与诚已亲近到可以直接称呼对方的名字，但诚这时没有把她当作为“一个女孩”。其后自称随意地看到诚手机的待机图片并觉得抱歉，其后安排言叶和诚之间的约会。但是，其原因是为了自己能接近诚，而诚在没有慎重考虑后轻易答应。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"当初是在诚的背后作为支援并周旋在诚和言叶之间，而令他们一起共进午餐亦帮助他们发展关系，其后与言叶交谈后知道诚和言叶互相对对方有意思并且言叶已接受了诚的告白，这对世界来说都是预计以外的事。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"其后为二人理应顺利的发展，世界不断抑制自己的感情，而在帮助诚约会言叶后吻了诚当作对自己的报答，但令这自己一手安排的关系和她本身的处境变得不正常。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"于‘Summer Days’中登场，但其处境与本作相反变成坏的，另外成为攻略对象以外的角色。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姓氏来自明治时代政坛元老，第12、14任日本首相西园寺公望"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"423"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"height":[{"comparisonValue":"155","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1597","value":"155"},{"comparisonValue":"155.3","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"423","value":"155.3cm"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0d0937047625979678e28733242b8ffca3d1f857b9919a1b0fc2b7ffee0a170c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/68/68ded08617b49de4bce9ec800a12726a40ae72913379da734395e4331f3ef64e.webp","width":183,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"河原木志穂","creatorId":"vndb:s13","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s13","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s13","name":"河原木 志穂","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:170113:423:4422:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c1598","characterName":"桂 言葉","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"424","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"170113"},{"characterId":"424","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"2423"},{"characterId":"424","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"28630"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6625"],"vndbCharacterId":"c1598"},"originalCharacterName":"桂 言葉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"104"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"102"},"height":{"reviewState":"pending-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"156"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Polite and reserved, Kotonoha Katsura is a student in year one of class four who is on the student council and serves as one of the most pivotal characters in the story. A cute and noticeably well-endowed bookworm, she becomes the initial love interest of Makoto early into their second term, and with some effort from Sekai Saionji, becomes his girlfriend after she reciprocates her affection for him. While Kotonoha for the most part is calm and gentle, she has a very delicate conscious, which under stress leads to irrational culpability, delusions and even malice. She has a younger sister name Kokoro and lives with their wealthy mother Manami and father in the fictional area of Haramihama. She is disliked by Otome Katou and is subject to her bullying and duress."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1598"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"榊野学園1年4組。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大人しく、内向的な性格だったが、伊藤誠と付き合うことで、少しずつ変わっていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"図書室には、よく通っているため、誠と付き合っているところを目撃した勇気に、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"相談を受けることになり、後に勇気の支援も受けて、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誠と付き合い続けるべく奮闘することになる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6625","sourceWorkId":"11694","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"同１年生で、誠や世界と違い、4組。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大人しく引っ込み思案な性格だが、人目を引く容姿（美貌と巨乳）のために、昔から男性恐怖症の気がある。クラスの女子一同から嫌われていて、男子からは距離を置かれて皆牽制しあっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"がっつかず、遠目から見ている誠のことを気にしていたが、介添えのように世界の仲介があり、誠の告白を受け入れる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6625","sourceWorkId":"13913","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"榊野学園１年４組。「桂心」の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"プロポーション抜群で、特に胸が大きいが、本人はむしろコンプレックスを感じていて、少しだけ男性が苦手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"インドア派で夏祭りにはのり気では無かったが、社交的な妹の勧めで参加していく事から彼女の夏休みは加速していく。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6625","sourceWorkId":"15294","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"榊野学園 1年生。 桂心の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスのいじめっ子・加藤乙女に、最愛の伊藤誠が助けを求めていると騙されて連れてこられた。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6625","sourceWorkId":"18834","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"誠の隣のクラスの女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"通学時の電車が同じで、以前から気になっていた。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6625","sourceWorkId":"23313","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“我觉得你很幸福，因为你可以选择爱我或不爱我，而我只能选择爱你或更爱你。”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"榊野学园1年4班。兴趣是阅读，而由于体质很差不擅长体育。得意作是言叶的母亲（桂真奈美，于『Summer Days』登场）传授的柠檬水。对血腥与恐怖电影有兴趣。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"桂言叶有着魔鬼般的身材和天使般的面容，以及和外表完全相反的内向性格。感性意识强烈，容易冲动。虽然已经有了男朋友，却对与男友密切接触有着强烈的抵触情绪。一般恋人之间应有的拥抱、亲吻行为她却完全做不来，性更是她无法逾越的障碍。但是她待人和善，对男友温柔体贴，以及极具东方女性美的外表，树立了她学生版大和抚子的形象，使她深受广大游戏玩家的喜爱。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"居住在豪华的独立房屋的有钱人，双亲都在工作。加上其妹心为4人家庭。是主要女主角之一。老实且畏缩不前的性格、轻度的男性恐惧症。当然，对性与恋爱相关的事相当害怕并陌生，但被同级的其它女子讨厌，受到乙女为首的同学欺负。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"实际上言叶精湛的刀法并不是黑化后精神失常而爆发出来的。之所以可以快狠且准，直击敌人的要害，这跟里其本身的设定有关。桂言叶的里设定之一就是个有武士魂的日本武士，而且也修有居合斩（拔刀术），续作Summer Days有言叶挥刀砍中从高处落下的水滴的片段。和剑道不同的是，剑道是和人拼命击剑，而居合道要的是一击必杀，所以都是瞄准颈动脉这些地方出招。这就是为什么言叶在黑化状态下也能趁其不意夺下世界的刀并瞬间将其秒杀。毕竟贵族家的子女必须会武术才能在将来挑起大梁。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"随着剧情的发展，各个人物角色都在情感斗争中陷入了不同的道德困境，而唯有桂言叶在形象上一直是未受损的受害者，从未尝试过算计他人；其次，即便是处于黑化失控的情绪下，桂言叶也从不会对心爱的对象（伊藤诚）下毒手；因而受到广大观众的好评，并被其称之为 “女神”、“言叶様”等称号。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在0verflow官方最爱角色排行榜中，言叶以没有悬念的高票数夺得头名，并以接近三倍的高票秒杀了第二位的清浦刹那。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姓名来源：第11、13、15任日本首相桂太郎"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"424"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"height":[{"comparisonValue":"156","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1598","value":"156"},{"comparisonValue":"156.7","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"424","value":"156.7cm"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/84/8458f58a1282fa61a02441ae7df2d05cc95b600ed6430056ab5ef54ab547f233.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8a/8ab8bb7c5ed8c2005885eca7ac841caca93466cd12d13389eaf89a188d4c634e.webp","width":183,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡嶋妙","creatorId":"vndb:s359","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s359","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s359","name":"岡嶋 妙","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:170113:424:4646:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c19190","characterName":"伊藤 萌子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"41163","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"170113"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8690"],"vndbCharacterId":"c19190"},"originalCharacterName":"伊藤 萌子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Makoto's mother."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c19190"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"伊藤誠の母で、看護師。 夫とは離婚済み。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誠と 2人で暮らしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8690","sourceWorkId":"23313","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"誠と止の母。看護師として働いている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"41163"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7e/7e40faa29f250622bedec56cb76348733d0416f8ebfa14684796daeb54e37b86.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7d/7ded2cebe99002e1f7e874e1c4f98cffd6c3cb3a917b51798587b26d0b97ca1a.webp","width":141,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"本井えみ","creatorId":"vndb:s124","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s124","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s124","name":"本井 えみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:170113:41163:4177:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c20251","characterName":"花山院 恭美","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"41210","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"170113"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6630"],"vndbCharacterId":"c20251"},"originalCharacterName":"花山院 恭美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kyouichi's younger sister, she is an extreme brocon. She is jealous of his girlfriend, Nanami and the number of women her brother's dated to the point she never tries to hide her affection for him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from School Days Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c20251"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"榊野学園に通う兄を持つ女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"兄のことが好きで、兄に近づく悪い虫を一掃しようと立ち上がる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6630","sourceWorkId":"18834","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"誠が通う学園の先輩の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ひょんなことから誠と知り合い、付き合うことになる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6630","sourceWorkId":"23313","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"恭一の妹。刹那と同じくらい小柄であり、「です・ます」口調が特徴。しっかり者であり、恭一のことも素直に慕っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"41210"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0dc377b93a53ab87d005877c2fd093851496ab04b705ac569f8c2fb4f1845f49.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f1/f1b9edd5ac24d35f1b9c1da8552fc0a82c86ccc084b04e211cb0f11106726285.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"眞田朱音","creatorId":"vndb:s610","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s610","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s610","name":"眞田 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:170113:41210:5928:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c7643","characterName":"大隈 二喜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"41209","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"170113"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6637"],"vndbCharacterId":"c7643"},"originalCharacterName":"大隈 二喜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Setsuna's and Sekai's childhood friend. Niki is a troublemaker whom Sekai chose to stop associating with due to this nature."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c7643"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"綿国女子学園 1年生。 刹那の幼なじみ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"戦いの血が疼くと言って参戦したが、エッチなことが大好きで、勝っても負けても楽しみを見出している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6637","sourceWorkId":"18834","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"世界の幼なじみで、誠たちとは違う学園に通っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性に奔放だが、それだけではなく何かを知っている様子を見せる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6637","sourceWorkId":"23313","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"世界と刹那の幼馴染の少女。世界とは顔も肢体も似通っており、髪には2本のアホ毛まで持つ他、喧嘩してもすぐ仲直りするほど仲が良い。また、葉音やいのり、路夏とも面識があり、結果として瞬の娘達の共通の知人となっている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"41209"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1e/1e499f8f3289eb1e94f3d2ca9af70b70a8ab1383aa6250bd710f249693cbfc8b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b3c1dca4361f6fd9c092be7e1640c6c7b6de573eadcd9e0138189d255e7936e2.webp","width":139,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"倉田まりや","creatorId":"vndb:s789","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s789","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s789","name":"澄田 まりや","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:170113:41209:6018:1","source":"bangumi"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p74","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:73","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p74","name":"Overflow","rol